------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party material
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The test corpus under `benches/wild/` contains small source excerpts copied
verbatim from third-party open-source projects (gin, ripgrep, serde, flask,
click) for use as a recall-regression benchmark. These excerpts remain under
their original upstream licenses (MIT / BSD-3-Clause), not reprise's license.

Full attribution, provenance, and the verbatim upstream license texts are in:

    benches/wild/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md
    benches/wild/licenses/

This material is a test corpus only. It is not part of the reprise binary and is
excluded from the published crate (Cargo.toml `exclude = ["benches/**"]`).
